{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"李家超周二起訪問北京和上海\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CE-BJ-261102-13.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超周二起訪問北京和上海。</p><p>李家超會到北京出席京港治談會開幕式，並與北京市官員會面。他周三會轉往上海，在周四參觀進博會，並在虹橋國際經濟論壇致辭。</p><p>李家超指，會通過今次行程推廣香港獨特優勢，鞏固香港作為內地企業走出去以及外國企業走進來的平台。他會在周五返港。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:40:46.456211+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:08:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:54.310127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:38:16.873597+00:00","content_hash":"7456ac388a8f65426c09b8f703dd8cf953cbc7b4bd443b5bbc18372a3dd1bf94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}